  {
   "t": "tr",
   "id": "S0007",
   "kind": "para",
   "s": "Quantum states, represented as linear superpositions of the eigenfunctions of an operator $\\hat{A}$, yield different eigenvalues of $\\hat{A}$, with probabilities given by the **square of the coefficients** in the superposition.",
