  },
  {
   "t": "tr",
   "id": "S0039",
   "kind": "para",
   "s": "The squared absolute values of the coefficients $\\mid c_n \\mid^2$ are equal to the probabilities $p_n$ of finding the system in a state $n$ described by eigenvalue $A_n$ and eigenfunction $\\mid \\phi_n \\rangle$ of the operator $\\hat{A}$.",
