   "s": "- ",
   "line": 174
  },
  {
   "t": "tr",
   "id": "S0042",
   "kind": "para",
   "s": "From the normalization condition imposed on the wavefunction we see the true meaning of the coefficients in a linear superposition.",
   "line": 174,
