   "s": "$$\\langle \\psi \\mid \\psi \\rangle = \\Big[c^*_1\\langle 1\\mid +c^*_2 \\langle 2\\mid \\Big]\\Big[c_1\\mid 1\\rangle + c_2 \\mid 2\\rangle\\Big] =\\\\ = \\mid c_1 \\mid^2 \\langle 1 \\mid 1 \\rangle+(c^*_1 c_2\\langle 1 \\mid 2 \\rangle+c_1 c^*_2\\langle 2 \\mid 1 \\rangle)+\\mid c_2\\mid^2   = c_1^2+c^2_2=p_1+p_2=1$$\n",
