  },
  {
   "t": "lit",
   "s": "$$\\psi(x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\Big(\\frac{2}{L} \\Big )^{1/2}sin\\frac{\\pi x}{L}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot \\Big(\\frac{2}{L} \\Big )^{1/2}sin\\frac{5\\pi x}{L}$$ \n",
